DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerMonica DesaiA damn good all-in
 doors day party in the Marina during SF Fleet Week.\nRight after the Blue 
 Angels wrap at Marina Green\, swing over to ERIA Marina on Chestnut Street
  (across Little Original Joe’s). We are bringing you an afternoon of sun
 -drenched Disco\, Funky\, and Melodic House on an audiophile sound system\
 , complete with live music featuring saxophone and percussion jamming alon
 gside our DJs.\n\nExpect sunlit windows\, a floating disco ball\, party bu
 bbles\, and custom drinks like Espresso Martinis\, Chai Spritzes\, and Sun
 set Prosecco.\nLineup (3:00 to 7:00 PM)\n\nDJs: MONĪ\, VIA & IRIS [Hybrid
  Set]\, .KINA\n\nLive Music: Jared The Sax Guy\, Ammo Drums\n\nLocation & 
 Details\n\nDate & Time: Sunday\, Oct 11 | 3:00 – 7:00 PM\n\nVenue: ERIA 
 Marina (2300 Chestnut St\, Across Little Original Joe’s)\n\nTickets & VI
 P\n\nEarly Bird: $25 | Advance: $30 | At the Door: $40\n\nVIP tables and b
 ottle service available. For inquires and reservations\, email: info@monic
 adesai.com\n\n$25.00\n\nTickets: https://www.ambrosia.events/moni/events/s
 aucy-sunday\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/saucy-sunday-day-party-sf/\n
 Source: Funcheap SF
