BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Off the Grid Treasure Island
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T130000
DTSTAMP:20261015T044918Z
UID:dothebay-17260589@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
DESCRIPTION:Off the Grid Treasure Island\nSaturdays | 11am–4pm | Citysid
 e Park\, Treasure Island\n\nRSVP FOR YOUR FREE ROUNDTRIP FERRY PASS!\n\nTw
 o Saturdays left on the island!\n\nOff the Grid Treasure Island wraps its 
 fall season with two big Saturdays at Cityside Park. First comes a Fleet W
 eek takeover with Dirtybird x EMPIRE on October 10\, then a pet-friendly f
 inale on October 17!\n\nAdmission is free\, and complimentary ferry servic
 e from the San Francisco Ferry Building is available with RSVP.\n\nSaturda
 y\, Oct 10: Fleet Week on Treasure Island\nDirtybird x EMPIRE take over th
 e stage\, alongside our biggest food lineup of the fall. Fleet Week's air 
 show is on the same weekend\, with the Blue Angels flying over the Bay. Br
 ing a blanket\, grab lunch and look up.\n\nSaturday\, Oct 17: Paws on the 
 Bay\, The Finale\nClose out the season with your four-legged crew. Her DJ 
 Club is on the decks for a pet-friendly send-off on the lawn.\n\nWhat to E
 xpect:\n\nFree Ferry from San Francisco\nRSVP for a free ferry pass coveri
 ng two adults and two children!\nEach pass is valid for one guest and one 
 free roundtrip ferry ride to and from Off the Grid Treasure Island. Passes
  are limited and do not reserve or guarantee a specific ferry departure ti
 me.\n\nOne Island. OTG Creators. Multiple Cuisines.\nEach Saturday\, more 
 than 15 food creators serve Vietnamese\, Korean\, Japanese\, Hawaiian\, Me
 xican\, Italian\, German\, BBQ\, fried chicken\, sandwiches and sweets. Th
 ere's something for every craving\, from go-to favorites to something enti
 rely...\n\nFree\nOff the Grid Presents\n\nTickets: https://offthegrid.com/
 treasureisland/\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/sat/off-the-g
 rid-treasure-island-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://assets0.dostuffmedia.com/uploads/aws_asset/aws_ass
 et/31665304/885c1fe6-f714-4d63-a71e-9afd592d3e9f.png
LAST-MODIFIED:20261015T044918Z
LOCATION:Cityside Park\, Treasure Island\, 387 Avenue of the Palms\, San F
 rancisco\, CA\, 94130
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/weekly/sat/off-the-grid-treasure-island-ti
 ckets
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SF’s Epic Halloween Pub Crawl “Crawloween 2026” (Dia De Los 
 Muertos)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261101T220000
DTSTAMP:20261017T105245Z
UID:funcheap-1642927@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Eating Drinking
DESCRIPTION:SF’s Epic Halloween Pub Crawl “Crawloween 2026” (Oct. 24
 -Nov. 1)\nCrawlSF\nThe San Francisco Halloween Pub Crawl 2026: Crawloween 
 Returns! This year\, it’s expected to be even bigger\, with new bars\, n
 ew surprises and four nights of non-stop Halloween excitement.\nOctober in
  San Francisco brings Fleet Week\, amazing weather and the San Francisco H
 alloween Pub Crawl\, better known as Crawloween. Produced by CrawlSF\, thi
 s massive 4-day event has become a Bay Area tradition\, bringing together 
 thousands of people for an amazing Halloween weekend filled with drinks\, 
 DJs\, costumes and a whole bunch of fun.\nIn 2025\, Crawloween drew over 2
 5\,000 people to bars across The Marina\, Russian Hill\, North Beach and P
 olk Village\, making it the largest Halloween event in San Francisco.\nThe
  2026 San Francisco Halloween Pub Crawl will take place over four days\, g
 iving you multiple chances to experience the biggest Halloween party in th
 e city.\nThe San Francisco Halloween Pub Crawl is a massive celebration of
  the best holiday of the year. Join the CrawlSF Team and thousands of your
  new best friends as you head from bar to bar along the pub crawl path. Th
 ere will be pub crawls on Saturday\, 10/24\, Friday\, 10/30\, Saturday 10/
 31 & Sunday\, 11/1.\n\nCrawloween 2026\nThe San Francisco Halloween Pub Cr
 awl\n\nSaturday\, October 24 – Halloween Bar Crawl (4-10p)\nFriday\, Oct
 ober 30 – Halloween Pub Crawl (6-11p)\nSaturday\, October 31 – Crawlow
 een – SF’s Biggest Halloween Party for 2026 – Over 25\,000 Attendees
  (2-10p)\nSunday...\n\n$15.00\n\nTickets: https://crawlsf.com/guides/san-f
 rancisco-halloween-pub-crawl/\nDetails: https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-epic-h
 alloween-pub-crawl-crawloween-2026-dia-de-los-muertos/\nSource: Funcheap S
 F
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/CrawlS
 F-Halloween-Pics-150-of-150.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261017T105245Z
LOCATION:Mayes Oyster House\, 1233 Polk St. San Francisco\, CA 94154
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/sfs-epic-halloween-pub-crawl-crawloween-2026-d
 ia-de-los-muertos/
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
